      "prompt": "Workflow 和 Agent 有什么区别？",
      "options": [

      ],
      "answer": {
        "mode": "rubric",
        "value": null,
        "referenceAnswer": "核心区别一句话：Workflow 是\"你告诉系统怎么做\"，Agent 是\"你告诉系统做什么，它自己决定怎么做\"。\n\nAnthropic 官方的划分标准：\n\n- Workflow = Orchestration framework + Predefined paths（预定义路径）\n\n- Agent = LLM dynamically directs its own processes and tool usage（LLM 自主控制）\n\n---",
